<title>USA: Unison sees 9 mos loss exceeding forecasts.</title>
<headline>Unison sees 9 mos loss exceeding forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unison HealthCare Corp, which is restating results for the nine months ended September 30, 1996, said Monday the pretax loss for that period will be &quot;significantly higher&quot; than the $5 million to $6 million loss previously estimated.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to report audited financial statements for 1996 within the next two weeks.</p>
